        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ANNSIM-SIMAUD-FORMAL-PROOFS-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FORMAL-PROOF-SUITE.
            05  WS-PHASE1-INGESTION-VALID   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-PHASE2-STRUCTURE-VALID   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-PHASE3-AXIOM-VALID       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-PHASE4-RULE18-CSUM-VALID PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-RULE18-CHECKSUM-VAL      PIC 9(09) VALUE 000015872.
            05  WS-FINAL-PROOF-WITNESS      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-MULTI-PHASE-CLOSURE.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-MULTI-PHASE-CLOSURE.
            IF WS-PHASE1-INGESTION-VALID = 1 AND
               WS-PHASE2-STRUCTURE-VALID = 1 AND
               WS-PHASE3-AXIOM-VALID = 1 AND
               WS-PHASE4-RULE18-CSUM-VALID = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-FINAL-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-FINAL-PROOF-WITNESS.
